{"articleNo":"2263","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2263&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009학년도 2학기 재입학 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.06.23","hit":"20564","attachments":[{"name":"2009학년도2학기재입학관련서식~.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2263&attachNo=1676"},{"name":"2009학년도2학기 재입학여석.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2263&attachNo=2183"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment--></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY목각파임B&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font size=\"3\">▣ 2009학년도 2학기 재입학 안내 ▣</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY목각파임B&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1. 재입학 대상</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;재학 중 자퇴, 미등록·미복학 및 학사경고 누적 등의 사유로 제적된 자.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2. 재입학 자격 제한</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -41pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">가. 학</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">부(과)의 재입학 심사에서 학생활동 등으로 제적된 자 중 개전의 정</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">이 없는 자로</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"> 인정된 경우.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학사경고로 제적된 후 1년이 경과되지 아니한 자.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 수학능력과 수업태도 등 학업활동을 계속할 수 없다고 판단되는 자.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 재입학 사실이 있는 자<font color=\"#ff0000\">(재입학은 1회에 한함)</font> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 재학연한초과자(재학연한은 12학기, 건축학전공은 14학기)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3. 재입학 신청 일정</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">가. 재입학원서 접수기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">2009. 7.14(화) ~ 7.16(목)[3일간]</font> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 재입학 신청 장소 :</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 해당“종합학사행정실”</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp;나. 재입학 허가일 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">2009. 8. 5(수)</font> </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">다. 수강신청 기간 </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2009. 8. 18(화) ~ 8. 19(수) 1학년, 4학년이상</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2009. 8. 20(목) ~ 8. 21(금) 2학년, 3학년</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">라. 등록 기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">2009. 8. 18(화) ~ 21(금)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4. 재입학 구비서류 양식</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"> : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">해당 종합학사행정실 비치 또는 학교 홈페이지 다운로드</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">가. 재입학 원서 1부(다운로드 가능)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학적부 사본 및 성적증명서 각 1부</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 학생 자필로 된 각서 및 학부장 추천서 각 1부(다운로드 가능)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">5. 기타사항</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 재입학은 여석이 있는 경우에 한하여 허가함.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 재입학은 제적 당시의 동일학년 이하의 학년에 한하여 허가함.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 제적 당시의 학부(과, 전공)로만 재입학이 가능함 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 재입학자가 기 취득한 학점 및 성적은 그대로 인정함.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -42.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 재입학 이전에 받은 학사경고와 휴학기간은 재입학 이후에 통산하지 아니함.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -38.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 38.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">마. 재</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">입학이 허가된 자는 소정의 기일 내에 입학금 및 기타 납입금의 납부 등 학적 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">절차를 이행하여야</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;하며, 하지 않을 경우 미등록 제적 처리함.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -42.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">바. <font color=\"#ff0000\">재입학 합격은 해당 종합학사행정실 및 학교 홈페이지 공지사항에서 직접 확인(개별 연락하지 않음)</font> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -38.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 38.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;사.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">2005학년도 이전 입학한 학생 중 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">기</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">계공학부, 전자공학부, 컴퓨터공학부, 건축학부</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">(건</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">축공학전공)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">,</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">토목환경공학부, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">신소재시스템</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">공</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">학부에 재입학하는 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">학생은 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">공학교육인증과정 또는 공학교육</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">비</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">인증</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">과정을 선택하여 이수해야 함.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -38.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 38.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;☞ 공학교육인증‧비인증 과정을 선택하지 않은 자만 해당</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -42.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">아. 학적부에 사진이 없는 학생은 사진 1장을 추가로“종합학사행정실”에 제출해야 하며, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">원스톱</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">서비스에 있는 주소와 연락처를 정확히 기재</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">하여야 함.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -42.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 사진이 없을 경우 성적 열람 및 수강신청 불가.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -42.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -42.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span></p>\n<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 8pt\"></span>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font size=\"3\">2009. 6. 23.</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 8pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font size=\"3\">금오공과대학교총장</font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
